# Vynutí LF konce řádků pro všechny textové a zdrojové soubory
* text eol=lf
# Binary files must never go through line-ending conversion: it rewrote bytes of
# anitka-mascot-full.webp and the mascot vanished from the guide.
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
# The gzipped Teta payload fixtures are binary too: the text filter replaced their bytes and the
# gzip CRC no longer matched, so the file in the repository was not the file the test reads.
*.gz binary
